#: ../../userpreferences.rst:3
msgid "Setting your preferences"
msgstr "Ag socrú do shainroghanna"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:5
msgid "As a user, you can manage your personal settings."
msgstr "Mar úsáideoir, is féidir leat do shocruithe pearsanta a bhainistiú."

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:7
msgid "To access your personal settings:"
msgstr "Chun rochtain a fháil ar do shocruithe pearsanta:"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:9
msgid "Click your profile picture to open the menu."
msgstr "Cliceáil ar do phictiúr próifíle chun an roghchlár a oscailt."

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:11
msgid "Nextcloud account menu showing Settings, Help, and Log out options"
msgstr ""
"Roghchlár cuntais Nextcloud ina bhfuil na roghanna Socruithe, Cabhair, agus "
"Logáil amach"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:14
msgid ""
"Click **Settings** in the dropdown menu to open your personal settings."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil ar **Socruithe** sa roghchlár anuas chun do shocruithe pearsanta a "
"oscailt."

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:16
msgid ""
"Nextcloud personal settings page listing profile, security, and notification"
" options"
msgstr ""
"Leathanach socruithe pearsanta Nextcloud ina liostaítear roghanna próifíle, "
"slándála agus fógraí"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:20
msgid ""
"If you are an administrator, you can also manage users and administer the "
"server. These links do not appear to a non-administrator user."
msgstr ""
"Más riarthóir thú, is féidir leat úsáideoirí a bhainistiú agus an freastalaí"
" a riaradh freisin. Ní fheictear na naisc seo d’úsáideoir nach úsáideoir é "
"nó í."

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:23
msgid ""
"The options listed in the Personal Settings Page depend on the applications "
"that are enabled by the administrator. Some of the features you will see "
"include the following:"
msgstr ""
"Braitheann na roghanna atá liostaithe ar an Leathanach Socruithe Pearsanta "
"ar na feidhmchláir atá cumasaithe ag an riarthóir. I measc cuid de na "
"gnéithe a fheicfidh tú tá:"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:27
msgid "Usage and available quota"
msgstr "Úsáid agus cuóta ar fáil"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:28
msgid "Manage your profile picture"
msgstr "Bainistigh do phictiúr próifíle"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:29
msgid ""
"Full name (You can make this anything you want, as it is separate from your "
"Nextcloud login name, which is unique and cannot be changed)"
msgstr ""
"Ainm iomlán (Is féidir leat é seo a dhéanamh rud ar bith is mian leat, toisc"
" go bhfuil sé scartha ó d'ainm logáil isteach Nextcloud, atá uathúil agus "
"nach féidir a athrú)"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:31
msgid "Email address"
msgstr "Seoladh ríomhphoist"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:32
msgid "List of your Group memberships"
msgstr "Liosta de bhallraíocht do Ghrúpa"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:33
msgid "Change your password"
msgstr "Athraigh do phasfhocal"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:34
msgid ":doc:`user_2fa`"
msgstr ":doc:`user_2fa`"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:35
msgid "User preferences"
msgstr "Roghanna úsáideora"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:36
msgid "Choose the language for your Nextcloud interface"
msgstr "Roghnaigh an teanga do do chomhéadan Nextcloud"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:37
msgid "Choose your preferred first day of the week"
msgstr "Roghnaigh an chéad lá den tseachtain is fearr leat"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:38
msgid "Links to desktop and mobile apps"
msgstr "Naisc chuig aipeanna deisce agus soghluaiste"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:39
msgid "Manage your Activity stream and notifications"
msgstr "Bainistigh do shruth Gníomhaíochta agus fógraí"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:40
msgid "Default folder to save new documents to"
msgstr "Fillteán réamhshocraithe chun doiciméid nua a shábháil chuige"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:41
msgid "Your Federated sharing ID"
msgstr "D'aitheantas comhroinnte Cónaidhme"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:42
msgid "Social sharing links"
msgstr "Naisc roinnte sóisialta"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:43
msgid "Nextcloud version"
msgstr "Leagan Nextcloud"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:46
msgid ""
"Available options and settings depend on your administrator's configuration."
" If you are not able to change the password or the display name in your "
"personal settings, please contact your administrator for help."
msgstr ""
"Braitheann na roghanna agus na socruithe atá ar fáil ar an gcumraíocht a "
"shocraigh do riarthóir. Mura féidir leat an focal faire nó an t-ainm "
"taispeána a athrú i do shocruithe pearsanta, déan teagmháil le do riarthóir "
"chun cabhair a fháil."

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:52
msgid "Sharing your data in the global address book"
msgstr "Do shonraí á roinnt sa leabhar seoltaí domhanda"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:54
msgid ""
"Some administrators share their global address book with other Nextcloud "
"instances (so-called *Trusted Servers*) or even with the wider world. This "
"is helpful when two instances want to work closely together, or when people "
"want to use Nextcloud as a virtual telephone book for others to browse. It "
"also allows searching for contacts, creating shares, and much more."
msgstr ""
"Roinneann roinnt riarthóirí a leabhar seoltaí domhanda le hinštansí "
"Nextcloud eile (ar a dtugtar *Freastalaithe Iontaofa*) nó fiú leis an domhan"
" mór. Bíonn sé seo úsáideach nuair a bhíonn dhá inštansí ag iarraidh oibriú "
"go dlúth le chéile, nó nuair a bhíonn daoine ag iarraidh Nextcloud a úsáid "
"mar leabhar teileafóin fíorúil ar féidir le daoine eile brabhsáil tríd. "
"Cuireann sé ar chumas úsáideoirí teagmhálaithe a chuardach, comhroinntí a "
"chruthú, agus go leor eile a dhéanamh."

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:60
msgid ""
"You can change what personal data is shared by setting the scope of your "
"data. Click the lock icon to open the following dropdown next to each entry:"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat a athrú cé na sonraí pearsanta a roinntear trí raon feidhme "
"do shonraí a shocrú. Cliceáil ar an deilbhín glais chun an roghchlár anuas "
"seo a leanas a oscailt in aice le gach iontráil:"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:63 ../../userpreferences.rst:100
msgid ""
"Visibility scope dropdown on a personal information field with Private, "
"Local, Federated, and Published options"
msgstr ""
"Roghchlár anuas do raon feidhme na infheictheachta ar réimse faisnéise "
"pearsanta, ina bhfuil na roghanna seo a leanas: Príobháideach, Áitiúil, "
"Cónaidhme, agus Foilsithe."

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:67
msgid ""
"If you set your data to **Private**, nobody but you will be able to see it."
msgstr ""
"Má shocraíonn tú do shonraí go **Príobháideach**, ní bheidh aon duine ach tú"
" in ann iad a fheiceáil."

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:69
msgid ""
"If you set your data to **Local**, all logged-in users within your Nextcloud"
" instance will be able to see the information, but no one outside of it."
msgstr ""
"Má shocraíonn tú do shonraí mar **Áitiúil**, beidh gach úsáideoir atá "
"logáilte isteach i do shuíomh Nextcloud in ann an fhaisnéis a fheiceáil, ach"
" ní bheidh aon duine lasmuigh de in ann í a fheiceáil."

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:72
msgid ""
"If you set your data to **Federated**, the trusted server(s) added by your "
"administrator will be able to see this data, in addition to all logged-in "
"users."
msgstr ""
"Má shocraíonn tú do shonraí mar **Chónaidhme** (Federated), beidh an "
"freastalaí (nó na freastalaithe) iontaofa a chuir do riarthóir leis in ann "
"na sonraí seo a fheiceáil, chomh maith leis na húsáideoirí go léir atá "
"logáilte isteach."

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:75
msgid ""
"If you set your data to **Published**, anyone can see your data. This is "
"useful in some cases. Someone with a public-facing role such as marketing or"
" sales might want to share their contact details with a wide variety of "
"connections who might not be using Nextcloud."
msgstr ""
"Má shocraíonn tú do chuid sonraí mar **Foilsithe**, beidh aon duine in ann "
"iad a fheiceáil. Tá sé seo úsáideach i gcásanna áirithe. D’fhéadfadh duine a"
" bhfuil ról poiblí aige — i réimse na margaíochta nó na díolachán, mar "
"shampla — a bheith ag iarraidh a shonraí teagmhála a roinnt le raon leathan "
"daoine, ar dócha nach n-úsáideann siad Nextcloud."

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:81
msgid "Restrict who can see your profile data"
msgstr ""
"Cuir srian leis na daoine ar féidir leo do shonraí próifíle a fheiceáil"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:83
msgid ""
"If the profile is enabled by your administrator, your profile data can be "
"read by other users and guests. To control who can see which information, "
"adjust the scopes mentioned above:"
msgstr ""
"Má tá an phróifíl cumasaithe ag do riarthóir, is féidir le húsáideoirí eile "
"agus le haíonna sonraí do phróifíle a léamh. Chun rialú a dhéanamh ar cé a "
"fheiceann cén fhaisnéis, coigeartaigh na scóip a luaitear thuas:"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:86
msgid ""
"**Private** will only allow you and users you have added to your phone book "
"to see the data."
msgstr ""
"Leis an rogha **Príobháideach**, ní bheidh ach tú féin agus na húsáideoirí "
"atá curtha le do leabhar teileafóin in ann na sonraí a fheiceáil."

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:87
msgid "**Local** and above will also allow guests to see your data."
msgstr ""
"Leis an leibhéal **Áitiúil** agus leibhéil níos airde, beidh aíonna in ann "
"do shonraí a fheiceáil freisin."

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:89
msgid ""
"To restrict the visibility further, you can prevent guests from seeing your "
"profile data by changing the profile visibility to logged-in users. In your "
"personal settings, find the profile visibility button:"
msgstr ""
"Chun an infheictheacht a shrianadh tuilleadh, is féidir leat cosc ​​a chur "
"ar aíonna sonraí do phróifíle a fheiceáil trí shocrú infheictheachta na "
"próifíle a athrú go dtí úsáideoirí atá logáilte isteach. I do shocruithe "
"pearsanta, aimsigh an cnaipe d’infheictheacht na próifíle:"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:93
msgid "Profile visibility toggle button in personal settings"
msgstr "Cnaipe scoránaigh do infheictheacht próifíle sna socruithe pearsanta"

#: ../../userpreferences.rst:98
msgid ""
"This allows you to configure the visibility for each profile attribute:"
msgstr ""
"This allows you to configure the visibility for each profile attribute:"
